      "explanation": "Division and multiplication share a level, so work left to right: 48 ÷ 6 = 8, then 8 × 2 = 16. Doing the multiplication first would wrongly give 48 ÷ 12 = 4.",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "48 ÷ 6 = 8.",
        "8 × 2 = 16."
      ],
      "formulaIds": [
